            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"variantcourt-research-notebook\">VariantCourt Research Notebook</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Research prototype - not for clinical diagnosis.</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The courtroom loop runs up to N rounds per variant. This notebook checks whether\neach round actually improves the case (fewer rejected claims, fewer open conflicts,\nstable criteria) and which <code>max_rounds</code> configuration is worth the latency.</span></span>"
